   "widgets_values": [
    "(sigh) Breeze TTS 2 is an absolutely incredible text-to-speech model, bringing seriously impressive voice quality, expression, and natural speech generation directly into ComfyUI. (clears throat) You can experiment with voice design and reference-guided voice direction, making it incredibly powerful for creators.\n\nAnd getting started is easy: you can download the ComfyUI nodes from the Breeze-TTS-2 project, along with quantized models and ready-to-use versions from DrBaph’s Hugging Face. (laugh) It’s fast, flexible, open, and genuinely feels like a huge step forward for local AI voice generation. If you’re using ComfyUI for creative work, Breeze TTS 2 is definitely one to check out.",
